{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32620","headline":"赠颛顼山人 · 刘沧","name":"赠颛顼山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩气含真玉片辉，着书精义入玄微。\n洛阳紫陌几曾醉，少室白云时一归。\n松雪月高唯鹤宿，烟岚秋霁到人稀。\n知君济世有长策，莫问沧浪隐钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}